Z||000022||West Coast Fiero||09-29-2001||10:06 PM||||Well, I am thinking of building up a sheet metal intake down to the heads out of aluminum for the 2.8 thats in my car, but I eventualy will put in a 3.8 turbo or 4.3 turbo<P>If I build up the intake and then swap, Ill prolly hand it over to you Drexter, but I can't gaurrantee horsepower, afterall - this is hot rodding, there are no gaurantees unless it has been proven<P>on a side note - Craig, found out the engine in my car came out of a Camaro, explains why the timing tap is in front of the crank<P><P>------------------<BR>Technician, West Coast Fiero<BR>www.cwestco.com<BR>310-305-4111||||reg||1
