Z||000024||DreXteR||09-30-2001||01:47 AM||||west coast fiero - That will be cool. The big problem of the 2.8 ~ 3.4 engine is the poorly intake runners. The are supper small for the type of power they can produce. Eaven the new hondas came with a nice diameter runners, thats why this small displacement engine make so much power. I saw the intake project of a 3.4 tdc tha really pump the power of that baby. My desing is dif the that but have its principles. But a few parts are the problem to make it done, but can be with a sort of changes. Anyway the idea is good to pump at least 20~40 hp (i beleiave it can do much) also is designed to take advantage of forced induction at max. <P>Besides the area51 pic, there are more pics or info? Im serious to develop it, well @least ideas, research and desings. The execution is where I stomped.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <P>DreX||||reg||10
Z||000025||DreXteR||09-30-2001||01:47 AM||||west coast fiero - That will be cool. The big problem of the 2.8 ~ 3.4 engine is the poorly intake runners. The are supper small for the type of power they can produce. Eaven the new hondas came with a nice diameter runners, thats why this small displacement engine make so much power. I saw the intake project of a 3.4 tdc tha really pump the power of that baby. My desing is dif the that but have its principles. But a few parts are the problem to make it done, but can be with a sort of changes. Anyway the idea is good to pump at least 20~40 hp (i beleiave it can do much) also is designed to take advantage of forced induction at max. <P>Besides the area51 pic, there are more pics or info? Im serious to develop it, well @least ideas, research and desings. The execution is where I stomped.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <P>DreX||||reg||10
