Z||000046||chester||10-04-2001||10:00 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by West Coast Fiero:<BR><B>it's never been tested - it is a 3.4 Twin Dual Cam throttle body matted up to a stock intake. It is intended to be used for a 3.4 push-rod engine, but no one has ever stepped up to the plate<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Maybe no one is stepping up to the plate because you want $400+ dollars for an intake that you NEVER tested.  Why would I want to pay $400 to tell you that it works/doesn't work? Give me a break. Put a realistic price on it and I'm sure someone will take a stab at trying it for you.<P>Rob D.<P><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigline.jpg">   <BR>Modified 2.8<BR>2.5" Drop<BR>11" Brakes<BR>17" Revolutions<BR>RCC Coilover Suspension||||reg||1
